<Version>1.21</Version>
<Item XName="ACPR" UserName="ACPR" Type="function">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>% Computes ACPR in dB&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;function out = ACPR( Spectrum, Freq, FCenter, MainChannelBW, AdjChannelIdx )&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;Flow = FCenter - MainChannelBW/2;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;Fhigh = FCenter + MainChannelBW/2;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;FlowIdx = find( Freq &gt;= Flow, 1, &apos;first&apos; );&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;FhighIdx = find( Freq &gt;= Fhigh, 1, &apos;first&apos; );&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;MainChannelPwr = sum( Spectrum(FlowIdx:FhighIdx) );&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;Flow = Flow + AdjChannelIdx * MainChannelBW;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;Fhigh = Fhigh + AdjChannelIdx * MainChannelBW;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;FlowIdx = find( Freq &gt;= Flow, 1, &apos;first&apos; );&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;FhighIdx = find( Freq &gt;= Fhigh, 1, &apos;first&apos; );&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;AdjChannelPwr = sum( Spectrum(FlowIdx:FhighIdx) );&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;out = 10*log10(AdjChannelPwr / MainChannelPwr);&#x000D;&#x000A;end</Text>
